WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,940 --> 00:00:14,110
Come back, Mr. Hu

2
00:00:15,290 --> 00:00:16,690
Lord, you said

3
00:00:17,510 --> 00:00:19,710
Can our business be done yet?

4
00:00:19,910 --> 00:00:21,710
Do of course do

5
00:00:22,310 --> 00:00:23,910
Throw everyone out here

6
00:00:24,110 --> 00:00:25,110
Don't dirty my place

7
00:00:25,710 --> 00:00:28,570
Mr. Li, wait for me sooner or later.

8
00:00:37,420 --> 00:00:43,880
Master, today I have paid two thousand five hundred dollars for being unreasonable.

9
00:00:44,610 --> 00:00:47,210
I'll add five hundred myself to make amends to you.
